\f1\fs22 Shakti Intelligence checked that it wasn\'92t an act of corporate espionage. One analyst thought it might be Fridge Force. Chip reminded them that Fridge Force hadn\'92t been incorporated with a sense of humour. A single look at Chip was all the evidence the analyst needed.\
Russia was ruled out. So were Canada, Pacifica and Andorra. The Screen Actors Guild denied involvement. The International College of Quantity Surveyors and Hip Hop Gangstas denied everything on principle. Cirque du Soleil said they were in their off-season, although Shakti Intelligence kept them on the list for another hour. They even ruled out Gliese 581d.\
There was nowhere in the known universe the message could have come from, even if it had been ejected from a black hole in the Big Sock, as some cosmologists hypothesised.
